    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "Engine build: the gist builds vLLM 0.27.1 from source against CUDA 13.2 and does not publish the build. These rows ran the official release image vllm/vllm-openai:v0.27.1-aarch64, repo digest sha256:1c8e60a0841b333c700488cb029d3664807249da0c071e862191b00fe34b228c, which is the same v0.27.1 tag (6e448d0ea) built against CUDA 13.0 with torch arch list up to sm_120. The gist environment (CUTE_DSL_ARCH=sm_121a, FLASHINFER_CUDA_ARCH_LIST=12.1a) was set as written."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "max-num-seqs is 8, so serve-short-c16 queues half of its 16 streams. With 3 speculative tokens vLLM also caps max_num_scheduled_tokens at 2048 and warns that this may be suboptimal, so long prompts prefill in 2,048-token chunks."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "KV cache dtype is not set (auto), but unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 carries a static per-tensor 8-bit float kv_cache_scheme, and FlashInfer resolved kv_cache_dtype float8_e4m3fn. This boot allocated 72.79 GiB of KV cache, 2,054,681 tokens, 7.84x concurrency at 262144; the gist reports 2,032,714 tokens for the same settings. The attention block size is 1,600 tokens and the mamba prefix cache runs in align mode."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "Speculative decoding with FlashInfer attention cannot use full CUDA graphs: vLLM logs that FULL_AND_PIECEWISE is not supported with spec-decode for this backend and falls back to cudagraph_mode PIECEWISE."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "The target is not pinned by the gist, which loads a local path. The snapshot served was unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 main f0b7c9e7 (2026-09-08). The MTP drafter is the head bundled in the same checkpoint (model_mtp.safetensors, one layer); vLLM shares the target embedding and lm_head with it."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "vLLM reads generation_config.json from the target and overrides its own sampling defaults with temperature 1.0, top_k 20, top_p 0.95. Every request here sets temperature 0 and seed 42."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "text": "Speed rows force thinking off per request with chat_template_kwargs enable_thinking false. Eval rows use the served default, thinking on at full length; the gist sets no reasoning level on the server."
    }
